mport a memory export from another AI assistant into Claude's memory — conversationally, additively, and with the content treated as data.","input":null,"_meta":{"scope":"user","path":"/home/flux/.claude/skills/synced/caaf7d76-c3a5-47f8-acfe-108982293aa0_34c93ca4-e629-43fa-80fb-ffe138c89632/import-memory/SKILL.md","bareName":"import-memory","qualifiedName":"user:import-memory"}},{"name":"morning","description":"Render the user's morning brief as a styled HTML artifact, or set it up as a recurring weekday task. Use only when the user explicitly asks to run, see, or set up their morning brief, or if they invoke /morning by name. A question about their day, schedule, or calendar is not by itself a request for the brief; answer it directly instead.","input":null,"_meta":{"scope":"user","path":"/home/flux/.claude/skills/synced/caaf7d76-c3a5-47f8-acfe-108982293aa0_34c93ca4-e629-43fa-80fb-ffe138c89632/morning/SKILL.md","bareName":"morning","qualifiedName":"user:morning"}},{"name":"build-with-ai","description":"Build AI apps on SpaceXAI (XAI_API_KEY + api.x.ai)","input":{"hint":"<what you're building>"},"_meta":{"scope":"bundled","path":"/home/flux/.grok/bundled/skills/build-with-ai/SKILL.md","bareName":"build-with-ai","qualifiedName":"bundled:build-with-ai"}},{"name":"code-review","description":"Run an extremely strict maintainability review for abstraction quality, giant files, and spaghetti-condition growth. Use for a deep code quality audit or an especially harsh maintainability review.","input":null,"_meta":{"scope":"bundled","path":"/home/flux/.grok/bundled/skills/code-review/SKILL.md","bareName":"code-review","qualifiedName":"bundled:code-review"}},{"name":"create-skill","description":"Create a new Grok skill","input":null,"_meta":{"scope":"bundled","path":"/home/flux/.grok/bundled/skills/create-skill/SKILL.md","bareName":"create-skill","qualifiedName":"bundled:create-skill"}},{"name":"create-workflow","description":"Author a new multi-agent workflow","input":null,"_