emove <number> | list | check | ship [on|off] [number...]"},"_meta":{"scope":"bundled","path":"/home/flux/.grok/bundled/skills/pr-babysit/SKILL.md","bareName":"pr-babysit","qualifiedName":"bundled:pr-babysit"}},{"name":"resume-claude","description":"Continue from a recent Claude Code session","input":{"hint":"[words describing the session | session id]"},"_meta":{"scope":"bundled","path":"/home/flux/.grok/bundled/skills/resume-claude/SKILL.md","bareName":"resume-claude","qualifiedName":"bundled:resume-claude"}},{"name":"resume-codex","description":"Continue from a recent Codex session","input":{"hint":"[words describing the session | session id]"},"_meta":{"scope":"bundled","path":"/home/flux/.grok/bundled/skills/resume-codex/SKILL.md","bareName":"resume-codex","qualifiedName":"bundled:resume-codex"}},{"name":"resume-cursor","description":"Continue from a recent Cursor session","input":{"hint":"[words describing the session | session id]"},"_meta":{"scope":"bundled","path":"/home/flux/.grok/bundled/skills/resume-cursor/SKILL.md","bareName":"resume-cursor","qualifiedName":"bundled:resume-cursor"}},{"name":"review","description":"Run a reviewer subagent against your whole branch vs main, your uncommitted working state, a named branch, a single GitHub PR, or an entire Graphite/stacked-PR stack (one reviewer subagent per PR). A bare /review defaults to reviewing your uncommitted working state when the tree is dirty, or your whole branch vs main when the tree is clean. Main, local, and branch modes write a review file plus a summary to disk. PR and stack modes post the findings as a PENDING GitHub review for the user to inspect and submit through the UI. Use --main for an explicit clean-tree branch review, --stack for stacked PRs, --submit to publish immediately as COMMENT, or --approve to publish and approve; the default remains PENDING.","input":{"hint":"[--main | --local | --branch <name> | --pr <number-or-url> | --stack <number-or-url> | <auto-detect>] [--approve | --submit]"},"_meta":{"scope":"bundled","path":"/home/flux/.grok/bundled/skills/review/SKILL.md","bareName":"review","qualifiedName":"bundled:review"}},{"name":"skill-design-principles","description":"Concise, high-signal principles for writing and editing skills well. Use whenever authoring or editing a skill.","input":null,"_meta":{"scope":"bundled","path":"/home/flux/.grok/bundled/skills/skill-design-principles/SKILL.md","bareName":"skill-design-principles","qualifiedName":"bundled:skill-design-principles"}},{"name":"statusline","description":"Configure the Grok Build status line.","input":null,"_meta":{"scope":"bundled","path":"/home/flux/.grok/bundled/skills/statusline/SKILL.md","bareName":"statusline","qualifiedName":"bundled:statusline"}},{"name":"threejs-frame-conventions","description":"One frame for Three.js controls, camera, and facing","input":null,"_meta":{"scope":"bundled","path":"/home/flux/.grok/bundled/skills/threejs-frame-conventions/SKILL.md","bareName":"threejs-frame-conventions","qualifiedName":"bundled:threejs-frame-conventions"}},{"name":"learn-traces","description":"Workflow: Map-reduce a collected set of Grok Build sessions into a curated list of harness changes: new or edited skills, plugin enables, deletes","input":{"hint":"[--agent-budget N] [--effort LEVEL] [args]"},"_meta":{"workflowSource":"bundled","workflowPath":"/home/flux/.grok/bundled/workflows/learn-traces.rhai"}}],"_meta":{"tools":["run_terminal_command","read_file","search_replace","list_dir","grep","kill_command_or_subagent","todo_write","get_command_or_subagent_output","spawn_subagent","scheduler_create","scheduler_delete","scheduler_list","monitor","search_tool","use_tool","workflow","enter_plan_mode","exit_plan_mode","ask_user_question","send_feedback","web_search","web_fetch","image_gen","image_edit","image_to_video","reference_to_video","write"]}},"_meta":{"totalTokens":21409,"requestTrimmedTokens":0,"eventId":"01a1d5c9-7699-77a1-86d4-238c790b9280-101","agentTimestampMs":17